;;;; Pakistan — federal public holidays, one block per year: the yearly
;;;; circular of public holidays and the notifications that fix the Eid,
;;;; Ashura and Milad days after the moon is sighted (Cabinet Division from the
;;;; 2022 list, Ministry of Interior before). :holidays are the declared dates,
;;;; each citing the document that set it; optional, minorities' and bank
;;;; holidays, days for one city or for six-day-week offices only, and the
;;;; half-day of 2011-03-30 are left out. :suppressed are rule days a later
;;;; circular cancelled. 2022-2026 :primary (cabinet.gov.pk); 2004-2021
;;;; :secondary (State Bank of Pakistan closure circulars, Press Information
;;;; Department releases and news). Every block and row carries :issued and
;;;; :published (#93). Read by pakistan-holidays-calendar
;;;; (src/starter-south-asia.lisp).

